<urn:atm:triage:finding/ATM-QA-003>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "ATM-QA-003" ;
  triage:title "AI.40 benchmark script not wired into CI" ;
  triage:description "Followup pass: user decision 2026-08-01 -- do NOT gate regular CI on live hardware benchmark runs. Benchmarks are environment-sensitive (M5 roster state, HTTP body-guard limits, host-specific flakiness already demonstrated false failures) and blocking merges on them reproduces exactly that noise. ATM-QA-003's requirement is downgraded from 'benchmark must run in per-PR CI' to 'benchmark tooling/evidence must exist and be reproducible on demand', which is already satisfied by run_admission_capacity.py plus the committed site/reports/send-message-benchmark/ evidence. Waiving the CI-wiring requirement; not dispatched for further dev work." ;
